      "source": "https://thesociableadventurer.com/aberdeen-nc/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Once a railroad hub, Aberdeen retains its nostalgic charm, highlighted by Union Station, now a museum that showcases the town’s past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://thesociableadventurer.com/aberdeen-nc/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Scottish emigrants first settled the area in 1745, giving Aberdeen its name and early cultural roots.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aberdeen%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Aberdeen’s proximity to Pinehurst sparked a tourism and retirement boom that still fuels the local economy today.",
